# kin/youth/wear/kaftan_hang: the kaftan's skirt to the ankles, open down the front: the linen inner garment between the
# gilt-trimmed edges, the cloth folds either side, a lit hem; the shoe tips show under it
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Keys as robe_hang (rest, wide, flare, kneel, lie).
# Motion fix round 3 (R3-06): the side (R, L) wide and flare keys (the side walk and run) end a row higher than rest, so
# the youth's thighs show under the hem (the tunic a lone hem row); the hang moves with the body on the down frames.
use person woman
body youth
role garment kaftan
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 4

